                    "product_hero_content_icon": "info",
                    "product_hero_content_title": "What is the Ontario Entrepreneur Stream?",
                    "product_hero_content_text": [
                        {
                            "product_hero_content_text_item": "The stream was designed for business owners and senior managers who wanted to invest in, establish or acquire a business in the province of Ontario.",
                            "product_hero_content_text_subs": false
                        },
                        {
                            "product_hero_content_text_item": "Investors had to run the Ontario business themselves to qualify for Canadian permanent residence.",
                            "product_hero_content_text_subs": false
                        },
                        {
                            "product_hero_content_text_item": "A spouse and children under 22 could be included in the same application.",
                            "product_hero_content_text_subs": false
                        },
                        {
                            "product_hero_content_text_item": "Ontario is one of Canada's major economic, political, cultural and service hubs, home to cities such as Toronto and Ottawa.",
                            "product_hero_content_text_subs": false
                        },
                        {
                            "product_hero_content_text_item": "The Ontario Entrepreneur Stream is closed to new applications. This page is kept for reference; if Canada is still your goal, our advisors can point you to the Canadian programs that are a better fit today. IMM Group's page states that the stream closed in February 2024; later updates to the Ontario Immigrant Nominee Program (OINP) show that the Entrepreneur Stream was formally closed on November 4, 2024, following a pause in application intake.",
                            "product_hero_content_text_subs": false
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ],
